<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Costello acts as Australian prime minister.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Costello acts as Australian prime minister.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will act as Australian prime minister in the absence of Prime Minister John Howard, who is attending the South Pacific Forum in the Marshall Islands, Howard's office said.</p>
<p>Howard returns on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade Minister and National Party Leader Tim Fischer, who's in China, would normally act as prime minister in Howard's absence.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2370</p>
</text>
